+*fontMenu*font6*Label:	Huge
+*VT100.font6:		10x20
+*fontMenu*font7*Label:	Enormous
+!*VT100.font7:		12x24
+*VT100.font7:		-adobe-courier-medium-r-normal--24-240-75-75-m-150-iso10646-1
+*fontMenu*fontescape*Label:	Escape Sequence
